it would have been 'boys will be boys.' \n\n#MeToo","userId":88934626,"media":null,"username":"PracticalLefty","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":4.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":7,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":4,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":4.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"920271227108937728","date":1508244733000,"rawContent":"@Alyssa_Milano @dash_bandy At 14 I was attacked in a park by a stranger while enjoying a walk alone. I lost consciousness when he knocked me down a hill...\n\n#MeToo","userId":88934626,"media":null,"username":"PracticalLefty","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":5.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":7,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":5,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":5.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"920271636988878848","date":1508244830000,"rawContent":"@Alyssa_Milano @dash_bandy ...and I have no memory of what happened, but when police took me home they were certain I'd been raped. I refused to go 2 hospital.\n\n#MeToo","userId":88934626,"media":null,"username":"PracticalLefty","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":6.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":7,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":6,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":6.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"920272376889270273","date":1508245007000,"rawContent":"@Alyssa_Milano @dash_bandy When I was 29 a boyfriend tried to strangle me when I told him I wanted to date other men. I saved my life by acquiescing...\n\n#MeToo","userId":88934626,"media":null,"username":"PracticalLefty","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":7.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":7,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":7,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":7.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"920273195885891585","date":1508245202000,"rawContent":"@Alyssa_Milano @dash_bandy For decades I didn't see that as rape because I 'consented.'\n\nI also didn't see his 'accidental' [aka forced]  anal sex as rape...\n\n#MeToo","userId":88934626,"media":null,"username":"PracticalLefty","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":8.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":7,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":8,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":8.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"920273612162117635","date":1508245301000,"rawContent":"@Alyssa_Milano @dash_bandy ...a few months earlier. After all, I *had* consented to vaginal sex. I minimized both incidents, as women are taught to do. \n\n#MeToo","userId":88934626,"media":null,"username":"PracticalLefty","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":9.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":7,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":9,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":9.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"920274202405621760","date":1508245442000,"rawContent":"@Alyssa_Milano @dash_bandy Those incidents are worst I have experienced. The 'least awful' was when I openly resisted 'flirtation' by my boyfriend's boss...\n\n#MeToo","userId":88934626,"media":null,"username":"PracticalLefty","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":10.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":7,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":10,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":10.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"920275197592264704","date":1508245679000,"rawContent":"@Alyssa_Milano @dash_bandy ...in front of his boss--nearly drop dead drunk @ the time. 'He was just having a bit of fun. He wasn't serious' my boyfriend said.\n\n#MeToo","userId":88934626,"media":null,"username":"PracticalLefty","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":11.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":7,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":11,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":11.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"920275550144552961","date":1508245763000,"rawContent":"@Alyssa_Milano @dash_bandy ...My boyfriend pointed out it was in front of his boss's wife, and she went along with it bc 'that's just the way he is,' he said.\n\n#MeToo","userId":88934626,"media":null,"username":"PracticalLefty","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":12.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":7,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":12,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":12.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"920275992098365441","date":1508245869000,"rawContent":"@Alyssa_Milano @dash_bandy ...so obviously his boss was 'just joking around.' I needed to get a 'sense of humor' about these things, my boyfriend insisted.\n\n#MeToo","userId":88934626,"media":null,"username":"PracticalLefty","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":13.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":7,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":13,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":13.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"920276880997126152","date":1508246081000,"rawContent":"@Alyssa_Milano @dash_bandy I personally know many women w\/similar experiences, incl rape. This includes mother &amp; my daughter--3 generations of rape victims...\n\n#metoo","userId":88934626,"media":null,"username":"PracticalLefty","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":14.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":7,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":14,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":14.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"920278788210135042","date":1508246535000,"rawContent":"@Alyssa_Milano @dash_bandy ...I would not be surprised if, later, I learn they, too, have been victims.\n\n#MeToo\n#myMotherToo\n#MyDaughterToo","userId":88934626,"media":null,"username":"PracticalLefty","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":15.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":7,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":15,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":15.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"920279534502596608","date":1508246713000,"rawContent":"@Alyssa_Milano @dash_bandy This infinite circle of women has to end NOW.\n\nNot one more generation of women should have to deal with this. NOT ONE.\n\n#MeToo","userId":88934626,"media":null,"username":"PracticalLefty","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":16.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":7,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":16,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":16.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"920498600131604480","date":1508298942000,"rawContent":"@m_bodenhamer I didn't think abt most of what I listed as assault until I started to respond to #MeToo \n\nIn fact, I just recalled another for what it was.","userId":88934626,"media":null,"username":"PracticalLefty","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":17.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":7,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":17,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":17.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"920498902859681792","date":1508299015000,"rawContent":"@m_bodenhamer My 1st year of college I did childcare for a family in exchange for room &amp; board to help my parents save $.\n\n#MeToo","userId":88934626,"media":null,"username":"PracticalLefty","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":18.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":7,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":18,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":18.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"920499186004611072","date":1508299082000,"rawContent":"@m_bodenhamer The day I moved into the house, the father crawled into the bed where I was sitting &amp; said, 'you look so pretty sitting there...'\n\n#MeToo","userId":88934626,"media":null,"username":"PracticalLefty","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":19.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":7,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":19,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":19.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"920499509544849409","date":1508299159000,"rawContent":"@m_bodenhamer His wife was away. I immediately scrambled off the bed &amp;started packing.\n\nThe wife came home shortly &amp;insisted 'he was just joking'\n\n#MeToo","userId":88934626,"media":null,"username":"PracticalLefty","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":20.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":7,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":20,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":20.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"920499828760760320","date":1508299235000,"rawContent":"@m_bodenhamer He was a wealthy donor to the college &amp; on its board of trustees. Bc of that I figured they'd lie if I went to the college about it.\n#MeToo","userId":88934626,"media":null,"username":"PracticalLefty","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":21.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":7,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":21,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":21.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"921059228806275073","date":1508432607000,"rawContent":"@BelaBaptiste @torresbelanna1 @guardian Now, go read #MeToo, then try to recall yr own similarly painful experiences w\/sexual harassment &amp; assault. Consider quantity &amp; intensity.","userId":88934626,"media":null,"username":"PracticalLefty","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":22.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":7,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":22,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":22.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"922135218038956032","date":1508689143000,"rawContent":"@gapperman1 @brianstelter @GretchenCarlson Don't believe it is pervasive?\n\nFor your willful ignorance I sentence you 2read every single post in #MeToo. I know you won't even look tho.","userId":88934626,"media":null,"username":"PracticalLefty","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":23.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":7,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":23,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":23.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"931107019754491904","date":1510828187000,"rawContent":"@jaketapper There are usually very painful reasons why young women get involved with older, married men. \n\nAnd there I was again, being brought back into it by a woman, a feminist no less., whom I thought for sure could see the underlying misogynist narratives &amp; didn't.\n\n#metoo #metooRound2","userId":88934626,"media":null,"username":"PracticalLefty","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":24.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":7,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":24,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":24.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"937427122393632769","date":1512335017000,"rawContent":"@ebonyfem123 Rosa Parks is turning over in her grave, shouting a very uncharacteristic 'OMFG!' at people who believe she'd never stand with #BlackLivesMatter nor #TakeTheKnee because 'real' racism was over and done with in the 60s. In fact, she'd be appalled at how much racism there still is.","userId":88934626,"media":null,"username":"PracticalLefty","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":2.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":8,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":24,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":1.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":1.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"940319546161946629","date":1513024624000,"rawCont